msgid "Quasi-diabatization"
msgstr "准透热化"

msgid ""
"This diabatization can be done automatically and requires two steps: first, "
"the active orbitals of a CASSCF calculation are rotated to maximize the "
"overlap with the orbitals at the reference geometry. This is achieved using "
"the ``DIAB`` procedure described in section `diabatic orbitals "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#diabatic-orbitals>`__. Secondly, the ``DDR`` "
"procedure can be used to find the transformation among the CI vectors."
msgstr ""
"此透热化可以自动完成，需要两个步骤：首先，旋转 CASSCF 计算的活性轨道，以最大化与参考几何结构处轨道的重叠。这是通过使用 `透热轨道 "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#diabatic-orbitals>`__ 一节中描述的 ``DIAB`` "
"程序实现的。其次，可以使用 ``DDR`` 程序来寻找 CI 向量之间的变换。"

msgid "The following input is required:"
msgstr "需要以下输入："

msgid "``DDR`` calls the DDR procedure."
msgstr "``DDR`` 调用 DDR 程序。"

msgid ""
"The results are printed and stored in the following Molpro variables, "
"provided the ``ENERGY`` directive or the ``EADIA`` variable is found:"
msgstr "结果将被打印并存储在以下 Molpro 变量中（前提是找到了 ``ENERGY`` 指令或 ``EADIA`` 变量）："

msgid "Results including the first-order orbital correction:"
msgstr "包含一阶轨道校正的结果："

msgid ""
"``UMAT`` The first :math:`nstate \\times nstate` elements contain the "
"transformation matrix."
msgstr "``UMAT`` 前 :math:`nstate \\times nstate` 个元素包含变换矩阵。"

msgid ""
"``HDIA`` The first :math:`nstate \\cdot (nstate+1)/2` elements contain the "
"lower triangle of the diabatic hamiltonian."
msgstr "``HDIA`` 前 :math:`nstate \\cdot (nstate+1)/2` 个元素包含透热哈密顿量的下三角部分。"

msgid ""
"``MIXANG`` Non-adiabatic mixing angle in degree. This is available only in "
"the two-state case."
msgstr "``MIXANG`` 非绝热混合角，单位为度。此结果仅在双态情况下可用。"

msgid ""
"The corresponding results obtained from the CI-vectors only (without orbital"
" correction) are stored in the variables [``SMATCI``], ``UMATCI``, "
"``HDIACI``, and ``MIXANGCI``."
msgstr ""
"仅从 CI 矢量获得（无轨道校正）的对应结果存储在变量 [``SMATCI``]、\\ ``UMATCI``\\ 、\\ ``HDIACI`` 和 "
"``MIXANGCI`` 中。"

msgid ""
"The way it works is most easily demonstrated for some examples. In the "
"following input, the wavefunction is first computed at the :math:`C_{2v}` "
"reference geometry, and then at displaced geometries."
msgstr ""
"其工作原理通过一些示例最容易说明。在下面的输入中，首先在 :math:`C_{2v}` 参考几何结构处计算波函数，然后在位移后的几何结构处计算。"

msgid "This calculation produces the following results:"
msgstr "此计算产生以下结果："

msgid ""
"The results in the first table are obtained from the CI-contribution to the "
"state-overlap matrix only, while the ones in the second table include a "
"first-order correction for the orbitals. In this case, both results are "
"almost identical, since the ``DIAB`` procedure has been used to minimize the"
" change of the active orbitals. This is the recommended procedure. If simply"
" natural orbitals are used without orbital diabatization, the following "
"results are obtained from the otherwise unchanged calculation:"
msgstr ""
"第一个表中的结果仅从状态重叠矩阵的 CI 贡献获得，而第二个表中的结果包含了对轨道的一阶校正。在这种情况下，两个结果几乎相同，因为使用了 "
"``DIAB`` 程序来最小化活性轨道的变化。这是推荐的程序。如果仅使用自然轨道而不进行轨道去绝热化，则从其他未更改的计算中获得以下结果："

msgid ""
"It is seen that the mixing obtained from the CI vectors only is now very "
"different and meaningless, since the orbitals change significantly as "
"function of geometry. However, the second calculations, which accounts for "
"this change approximately, still gives results in quite good agreement with "
"the calculation involving diabatic orbitals."
msgstr ""
"可以看出，仅从 CI "
"向量获得的混合现在非常不同且没有意义，因为轨道随几何结构的变化而显著改变。然而，第二个计算近似地考虑了这种变化，其结果仍然与涉及绝热轨道的计算相当吻合。"

msgid ""
"The final examples shows a more complicated input, which also computes the "
"non-adiabatic coupling matrix elements. In a two-state model, the NACME "
"should equal the first derivative of the mixing angle. In the example, the "
"NACME is computed using the 3-point ``DDR`` method (NACMECI), and also by "
"finite difference of the mixing angle (DCHI)."
msgstr ""
"最后的示例展示了一个更复杂的输入，该输入还计算了非绝热耦合矩阵元。在双态模型中，NACME 应等于混合角的一阶导数。在该示例中，NACME 使用三点 "
"``DDR`` 方法（NACMECI）计算，也通过混合角的有限差分（DCHI）计算。"

msgid "The calculation produces the following table"
msgstr "该计算产生以下表格"

msgid ""
"As expected the coupling matrix elements obtained from the 3-point ``DDR`` "
"calculation (NACMECI) and by differentiating the mixing angle (DCHI) are in "
"close agreement."
msgstr "正如预期的那样，从三点 ``DDR`` 计算（NACMECI）和通过微分混合角（DCHI）获得的耦合矩阵元非常一致。"
